				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				4.6.10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>c.</b> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁδῷ</span>) <i>in another</i> or
				<i>a different way</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καὶ τῇδε φῦναι χἀτέρᾳ</span>”
