					S.
					<u>OC</u>
					1444
				</span></i>
			; <i>another way</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρέπεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Nu.</u>
					812
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑτέρᾳ πῃ</span>”
