					5
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> adverb. with
			Preps.: </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>a.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ θάτερα</span>
			<i>to the one</i> or <i>the other side, one</i> or <i>the other
				way</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ μὲν θάτερα . . , ἐπὶ
				θ. δὲ</span> . . <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				7
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τότε μὲν ἐπὶ θάτερα, τότε δ᾽
