				Th.
				1.87
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ τοῦ ἐπὶ θάτερα</span>
			<i>from the other side</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				7.37
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ μὲν τοῦ ἐπὶ θ., ἐκ δὲ τοῦ
