				Pl.
				<u>Prt.</u>
				314e
			</span></i>: c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς τὰ ἐπὶ θ. τοῦ ποταμοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					7.84
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς τἀπὶ θ. τῆς πόλεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					6.2.7
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἐπὶ θάτερον τῆς ῥινός</span>”
