					<u>Art.</u>
					35
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ θάτερα</span>
			<i>on the one</i> or <i>other side</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ θ. ἀστός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					57.30
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψόφου κατὰ θ. προσπεσόντος</span>”
